 * Deep-space black #000000, Liquid-Glass blue #007AFF -> teal #30B0C7
 * gradient superellipse. Sounds: soft sine chimes (C5/E5/G5) generated by
 * tools/make-appleux-sounds.py, no Apple audio reused.
 */
object AppleuxBrandTokens {
